    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 283,
   "text": "15\n %\n people self-identify as disabled.\n Source\n 253 \n m\n people with visual impairments.\n Source\n 39\n countries with web accessibility law.\n Source\n Learn more about the statistics in the first module for Learn Accessibility:\n What is digital accessibility, and why does it matter?",
   "counts": {
    "links": 4,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 9,
